	'k0122d740' => 'The examination follows three principles, in this order, on every first visit. Listening takes the longest. The hands come next, with a reflex hammer, a tuning fork, and a pen and paper. A scan is ordered only when its result would change the plan, and the reason is written down.',
	'k02813504' => '2nd floor, 14 Linden Row, Westmere',
